{"data":{"playlet_id":"21277","bg_color":"","button_color":"","image_link":"https://cdn.wtzw.com/bookimg/public/images/playlet_cover/cover/100042/6890abe76a885.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,m_fixed,w_330/quality,q_80","intro":"《抚远不远》是一部聚焦都市人精神困境与乡土治愈的现实主义小说。主人公宋瑾在职场斗争中身心俱疲，回到东北抚远的一个小镇后，通过重新融入乡土生活，逐渐疗愈内心的创伤。作品以细腻的笔触描绘了都市与乡村的文化碰撞，展现了传统节气习俗、自然风物和人情温暖对现代人的救赎力量。同时，通过宋瑾与顾扬的情感萌芽、老人们对爱情的讨论等支线，探讨了当代人对爱情、归属与自我价值的思考。","is_follow":"0","is_off":"0","is_over":"1","latest_watch_index":"0","own_record_number":"（七猫）网微剧备字（2025）第06972号","tags":"现实题材","title":"抚远不远","title_color":"","total_episode_num":"33","play_list":[{"video_id":"1816246","video_url":"https://cdn-vod-playlet.wtzw.com/asset/b1334fc08e4805f4c721ea188f0f8704/play_multi_video/6f7310c287644b7c813ab8e2eb7a4a0c/31817ee267e32a77b6dc6f3aaeacb4f6.m3u8","duration":"123","first_img":"https://cdn.wtzw.com/bookimg/public/images/playlet_cover/frame/21277/1j1qjlb2qWmxTMeBCfCJASEEStmpz.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,m_fixed,w_330/quality,q_80","sort":"1","video_h265_url":"https://cdn-vod-playlet.wtzw.com/asset/b1334fc08e4805f4c721ea188f0f8704/play_multi_video/d65efb46b8ef46708d342d3cc44a1cd5/index.m3u8","width":1280,"height":720,"biz_type":"900","status":1},{"video_id":"1816222","video_url":"https://cdn-vod-playlet.wtzw.com/asset/cec6eafdf5c024faa72137be5a2ea6d0/play_multi_video/6f7310c287644b7c813ab8e2eb7a4a0c/805499d32301f4ecc06222d916a248ff.m3u8","duration":"75","first_img":"https://cdn.wtzw.com/bookimg/public/images/playlet_cover/frame/21277/1j1qjkeseFsPtiEKyWxP7Xr4jpzhf.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,m_fixed,w_330/quality,q_80","sort":"2","video_h265_url":"https://cdn-vod-playlet.wtzw.com/asset/cec6eafdf5c024faa72137be5a2ea6d0/play_multi_video/d65efb46b8ef46708d342d3cc44a1cd5/index.m3u8","width":1280,"height":720,"biz_type":"900","status":1},{"video_id":"1816237","video_url":"https://cdn-vod-playlet.wtzw.com/asset/8c273fd440fd3e573296affd7faeb6be/play_multi_video/6f7310c287644b7c813ab8e2eb7a4a0c/924de13cd1ce329bb2e43fa001ace42